  "description": "The DevExpress Office File API is a powerful .NET library that allows you to fully automate common document processing tasks and use-case scenarios. It includes the Spreadsheet Document API, Word (RTF) Document API, PDF Document API, and other Office-inspired components. Use the Office File API library to create, load, modify, save, and print rich text documents, spreadsheets, and PDF files, convert measurement units, generate barcodes, and compress data.",
